 drivers/resctrl/Kconfig          |  15 +++++
 drivers/resctrl/Makefile         |   1 +
 drivers/resctrl/cbqri_capacity.c | 132 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 149 insertions(+)

